%% M1 CLI test call (local policy + ARI originate + one-way TTS)
%% Rules (never):
%% never Place call when policy rejects
%% never Play agent audio before callee answers
%% never Hang up before 30 seconds after answer on the M1 verification call
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> PolicyCheck: start m1-test-call
  PolicyCheck --> Rejected: policy fail
  PolicyCheck --> PrepareAudio: policy ok
  Rejected --> [*]: exit rejected_by_policy
  PrepareAudio --> Originating: TTS or fixture alaw ready
  Originating --> Ringing: ARI channel created
  Ringing --> Failed: busy / error
  Ringing --> Answered: callee 200 OK
  Failed --> [*]
  Answered --> PlayingAgent: play disclosure + test sentence
  PlayingAgent --> Holding: playback started
  Holding --> CollectDtmf: keep call up
  CollectDtmf --> Hangup: hold >= 30s
  Hangup --> [*]: log DTMF, finalize
